  "notes": [
    "Reflexive form of *decidir* (to decide); fully regular -IR verb",
    "*decidirse a + infinitive* = to make up one's mind to do something (*Por fin me decidí a llamarle* — I finally brought myself to call him)",
    "*decidirse por* = to decide on / to choose (*Me decidí por el rojo* — I decided on the red one)",
    "Past participle: *decidido*",
    "*decidido/a* (adjective) = determined, decisive"
  ],
